    - file_path: calculator/advanced_calculator.go
      start_line: 132
      end_line: 135
      severity: |
        HIGH
      description: |
        `addToHistory` 方法使用 `append` 来添加历史记录，这会导致频繁的内存重新分配。当历史记录数量较大时，性能会显著下降。
      requirement_reference: |
        无明确性能要求，但历史记录功能应具备良好的扩展性
      code_suggestion:
        existing_code: |
          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) addToHistory(record string) {
            ac.history = append(ac.history, record)
          }
        improved_code: |
          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) addToHistory(record string) {
            if cap(ac.history) == len(ac.history) {
              newHistory := make([]string, len(ac.history), 2*len(ac.history)+1)
              copy(newHistory, ac.history)
              ac.history = newHistory
            }
            ac.history = append(ac.history, record)
          }
      confidence: 90
    - file_path: calculator/advanced_calculator.go
      start_line: 68
      end_line: 76
      severity: |
        HIGH
      description: |
        `Factorial` 方法使用循环计算阶乘，但未对输入值进行缓存。对于重复计算相同值的阶乘时，会造成不必要的计算开销。
      requirement_reference: |
        无明确性能要求，但阶乘计算应考虑重复计算场景
      code_suggestion:
        existing_code: |
          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) Factorial(n int) (int, error) {
            if n < 0 {
              return 0, errors.New("不能计算负数的阶乘")
            }
            if n > 20 {
              return 0, errors.New("数值过大，阶乘结果超出int范围")
            }
            
            result := 1
            for i := 2; i <= n; i++ {
              result *= i
            }
            ac.addToHistory(fmt.Sprintf("%d! = %d", n, result))
            return result, nil
          }
        improved_code: |
          var factorialCache = make(map[int]int)

          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) Factorial(n int) (int, error) {
            if n < 0 {
              return 0, errors.New("不能计算负数的阶乘")
            }
            if n > 20 {
              return 0, errors.New("数值过大，阶乘结果超出int范围")
            }
            
            if result, exists := factorialCache[n]; exists {
              return result, nil
            }
            
            result := 1
            for i := 2; i <= n; i++ {
              result *= i
            }
            factorialCache[n] = result
            ac.addToHistory(fmt.Sprintf("%d! = %d", n, result))
            return result, nil
          }
      confidence: 88
