      description: |
        所有数学运算方法中都重复了相同的历史记录添加逻辑，违反了DRY原则。当需要修改历史记录格式或逻辑时，需要在多个地方进行修改，增加了维护成本。
      requirement_reference: |
        DRY原则：避免重复代码
      code_suggestion:
        existing_code: |
          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) Add(a, b float64) float64 {
              result := a + b
              ac.addToHistory(fmt.Sprintf("%.2f + %.2f = %.2f", a, b, result))
              return result
          }
        improved_code: |
          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) Add(a, b float64) float64 {
              result := a + b
              ac.recordOperation("+", a, b, result)
              return result
          }

          func (ac *AdvancedCalculator) recordOperation(op string, a, b, result float64) {
              ac.addToHistory(fmt.Sprintf("%.2f %s %.2f = %.2f", a, op, b, result))
          }
      confidence: 90

    - category: |
        Coupling
      file_path: calculator/interactive_calculator.go
      start_line: 63
      end_line: 99
      description: |
        handleChoice方法中直接耦合了所有操作的处理逻辑，导致该方法过于庞大且难以维护。当需要添加新操作时，必须修改这个方法，违反了开闭原则。
      requirement_reference: |
        开闭原则：对扩展开放，对修改关闭
      code_suggestion:
        existing_code: |
          func (ic *InteractiveCalculator) handleChoice(choice string, reader *bufio.Reader) {
              switch choice {
              case "1":
                  ic.handleBinaryOperation("加法", reader, func(a, b float64) float64 {
                      return ic.calc.Add(a, b)
                  })
              // ... 其他case
              }
          }
        improved_code: |
          type operationHandler struct {
              name     string
              handler  func(*InteractiveCalculator, *bufio.Reader)
          }

          var operations = map[string]operationHandler{
              "1": {"加法", func(ic *InteractiveCalculator, r *bufio.Reader) {
                  ic.handleBinaryOperation("加法", r, ic.calc.Add)
              }},
              // ... 其他操作
          }

          func (ic *InteractiveCalculator) handleChoice(choice string, reader *bufio.Reader) {
              if op, exists := operations[choice]; exists {
                  op.handler(ic, reader)
              } else {
                  fmt.Println("❌ 无效的选择，请重新输入")
              }
          }
      confidence: 88

